        "id": 51766,
        "name": "j1hopki1",
        "username": "j1hopki1",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-01-10T02:06:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"ketigid\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> ketigid:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Rule 3 is quite thematic in the sense that when enough cultists gather, they sacrifice something or someone and bring forth a relic. I think that's the atmosphere that the Gloomweaver deck will convey with rule 3.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Does rule 3 get him to 50% flippage? A guess is fine. My guess is rule 3 gets him to flipping like 20% of the time. He's maybe at 1% without any house rules.</p>",
