      {
        "id": 51774,
        "name": "Envisioner",
        "username": "Envisioner",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-04T19:22:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm inclined to think all of these are excessive.&nbsp; I found Gloomy to be a fairly credible threat in all three of my games against him; he's more like a 2 than a 3, but I'm fine with that.&nbsp; The only thing that bugs me is the ability to attack him directly, instead of waiting for the relics; it makes him feel less like a Call of Cthulhu villain, since you generally can't beat those up directly.</p>",
